Aku udah latihan di sekolah, jadi gak masalah.

35
00:02:04,272 --> 00:02:07,039
Nanti aku ajarin kakak.

36
00:02:07,062 --> 00:02:08,434
Tolong ya.

37
00:02:08,457 --> 00:02:12,024
Oke, udah siap. Yuk berangkat!

38
00:02:12,047 --> 00:02:15,880
Jangan lupa kartu stempelnya.

39
00:02:15,903 --> 00:02:18,115
Wah, hampir aja lupa.

40
00:02:18,139 --> 00:02:20,739
Tadi taruh di atas meja.

41
00:02:20,762 --> 00:02:23,729
Ayo, berangkat sekarang!

