Ide bagus banget!

64
00:03:45,067 --> 00:03:47,700
Bawa uang saku ya.

65
00:03:47,723 --> 00:03:52,157
Di kolam renang, kita harus berenang dengan tenang ya?

66
00:03:52,180 --> 00:03:57,659
Guru-guru banyak yang ngawas, kalau ribut bisa kena marah lho.

67
00:03:57,683 --> 00:03:59,749
Awas ya.

68
00:03:59,772 --> 00:04:02,047
Nanti ketemu lagi ya.

69
00:04:02,071 --> 00:04:03,304
Udah.

70
00:04:03,327 --> 00:04:06,094
Jam setengah satu di depan gerbang ya.

71
00:04:06,117 --> 00:04:08,093
Jangan telat lho.

72
00:04:08,117 --> 00:04:09,450
Nggak kok.

73
00:04:09,473 --> 00:04:12,141
Aku buru-buru naik sepeda kok.

74
