75
00:04:21,846 --> 00:04:24,846
Scene 3: Keramaian Liburan Obon / Tantangan Perjalanan Saat Liburan Obon

76
00:04:24,846 --> 00:04:29,126
Minggu depan sudah libur Obon ya.

77
