Aku mau pulang ke kampung halaman.

79
00:04:38,466 --> 00:04:41,899
Sudah pesan tiket Shinkansen.

80
00:04:41,922 --> 00:04:43,927
Bagus ya.

81
00:04:43,951 --> 00:04:49,040
Tiket Shinkansen mudah didapat?

82
00:04:49,063 --> 00:04:52,230
Nggak, susah banget.

83
00:04:52,253 --> 00:04:57,292
Saat liburan Obon memang benar-benar merepotkan.

84
