Oh, itu obat nyamuk.

126
00:07:55,143 --> 00:07:57,676
Biar nyamuknya nggak datang.

127
00:07:57,699 --> 00:08:00,666
Baunya khas banget.

128
00:08:00,689 --> 00:08:04,422
Tapi baunya bikin tenang juga.

129
00:08:04,445 --> 00:08:09,378
Kalau sore nanti, kita main ke sungai dekat sini yuk.

130
00:08:09,401 --> 00:08:10,368
Sungai?

131
00:08:10,391 --> 00:08:12,484
Bisa berenang?

132
00:08:12,507 --> 00:08:14,507
Bisa kok.

133
00:08:14,531 --> 00:08:19,331
Airnya jernih banget, dingin, dan enak.

134
00:08:19,354 --> 00:08:20,958
Mau banget!

135
00:08:20,981 --> 00:08:23,181
Ada ikannya nggak?

136
00:08:23,204 --> 00:08:26,470
Banyak ikan kecilnya.

137
00:08:26,493 --> 00:08:29,633
Kalau beruntung, bisa jadi kamu bisa menangkapnya.

138
00:08:29,657 --> 00:08:31,390
Nggak sabar!

139
00:08:31,413 --> 00:08:36,746
Awalnya aku kira desa bakal bikin bosan, tapi ternyata banyak juga yang seru.

140
00:08:36,769 --> 00:08:38,742
Iya, betul.

141
00:08:38,766 --> 00:08:44,017
Malam nanti bintangnya kelihatan cantik banget, itu juga bisa dinanti-nanti.

142
00:08:44,040 --> 00:08:49,933
Di Tokyo bintangnya jarang kelihatan, jadi aku pengen cepat-cepat malam.

143
00:08:49,957 --> 00:08:54,490
Kalau gitu, sekarang istirahat dulu bentar yuk.

144
00:08:54,513 --> 00:08:57,513
Scene 5: Persiapan Kemah Musim Panas dan Kekhawatiran

145
00:08:57,513 --> 00:09:02,970
Minggu depan mulai kemah musim panas klub tenis, ya.

146
