Coba kita ke perpustakaan dekat sini.

181
00:11:29,994 --> 00:11:34,034
Di sana sepi dan mungkin ada tempat duduk.

182
00:11:34,058 --> 00:11:36,143
Iya, benar.

183
00:11:36,166 --> 00:11:42,533
Selama liburan musim panas, banyak godaan di rumah, jadi susah fokus.

184
00:11:42,556 --> 00:11:44,805
Aku mengerti.

185
